# deps/imgui and deps/minhook are VENDORED, not cloned - see deps/UPSTREAM.md.
# ImGui is a fork of ours (the neverlose UI port modifies imgui.cpp /
# imgui_widgets.cpp / imgui.h in place), so re-cloning it would silently throw
# the port away. Both are tracked on purpose.
#
# cs2-dumper is different: a reference checkout of a third-party Rust tool that
# nothing here builds or links, kept locally only to read its offset patterns.
deps/cs2-dumper/

